"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd:p004","text":"累遷太子洗馬中舍人並掌東宮管記昭明太子愛文學士常與筠及劉孝綽陸倕到洽殷芸等遊宴玄圃太子獨執筠袖撫孝綽肩而言曰所謂左把浮丘袖右拍洪崖肩其見重如此筠又與殷芸以方雅見禮焉出為丹陽尹丞北中郎諮議參軍遷中書郎奉勅製開善寺寶誌大師碑文詞甚麗逸又勅撰中書表奏三十卷及所上賦頌都為一集俄兼寧遠湘東王長史行府國郡事除太子家令復掌管記","mentions":[{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd:p004:u0020","person_id":null,"surface":"文學士","start":20,"end":23,"kind":"unresolved","status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"太子文學士合稱。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd:p004:m0025","person_id":"mxz_qw8_acd_A","surface":"筠","start":25,"end":26,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"殿本依本段所書姓名與上下文。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd:p004:m0027","person_id":"di1_zqb_t0f","surface":"劉孝綽","start":27,"end":30,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"殿本依本段所書姓名與上下文。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd:p004:m0030","person_id":"war_qdw_fs5","surface":"陸倕","start":30,"end":32,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"殿本依本段所書姓名與上下文。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd:p004:m0032","person_id":"4mr_j4p_k5h","surface":"到洽","start":32,"end":34,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"殿本依本段所書姓名與上下文。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd:p004:m0034","person_id":"8d4_fth_d4l","surface":"殷芸","start":34,"end":36,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"殿本依本段所書姓名與上下文。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd:p004:m0045","person_id":"mxz_qw8_acd_A","surface":"筠","start":45,"end":46,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"殿本依本段所書姓名與上下文。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd:p004:m0048","person_id":"di1_zqb_t0f","surface":"孝綽","start":48,"end":50,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"殿本依本段所書姓名與上下文。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyun-wyd:p004:m0058","person_id":"5fx_jxq_ms6","surface":"浮丘","start":58,"end":60,"kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"殿本依本段所書姓名與上下文。"},{"id":"c-liangshu-033-wangyu